+ * unnoticed only because gemini-a72-online fires at ~240 s, well clear of it.
+ *
+ * Holding a real reference fixes this by construction: a regulator with a
+ * consumer is not unused. It also replaces hand-rolled i2c with
+ * regulator_set_voltage(), and a "proc" supply on the CPU node is exactly what
